{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LcxhfRiPGmKGuWgF5nesUs","type":"tool_result","content":"commit 0d1bb2f9ab42cdb394540932f9048df1cf526a89\nAuthor: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>\nDate:   Wed Apr 15 15:36:26 2026 +0200\n\n    Batch Round 0 descriptor arrays with PRUNE_SHMEM_KERNELS\n    \n    Add batched descriptor-array CUDA kernels for Round 0 zerocheck and logup\n    evaluation of small AIRs, plus caller-level routing in sumcheck_uni_round0_polys.\n    \n    CUDA changes:\n    - Round0ZcCtx/Round0LogupCtx per-AIR descriptor structs\n    - batched_zerocheck_r0_coset_parallel_kernel: 1D grid with BlockCtx mapping\n    - batched_logup_r0_coset_parallel_kernel: same pattern with identity-coset\n    - Only GLOBAL=true, NEEDS_SHMEM=false instantiated to minimize cubin size\n    \n    Rust changes:\n    - #[repr(C)] FFI structs (Round0BlockCtx, Round0ZcCtx, Round0LogupCtx) and wrappers\n    - New round0_batched.rs module: identify_batchable_airs() + batch_round0_small_airs()\n      writes directly to d_batch_array via existing GPU extraction kernels\n    - Caller routing in sumcheck_uni_round0_polys (Phase 1b before multi-stream dispatch)\n    \n    Build changes:\n    - PRUNE_SHMEM_KERNELS compile flag halves Round 0 template instantiations\n      (safe when skip_domain <= WARP_SIZE, i.e. l_skip <= 5)\n    - Reduces libcuda-backend.a from 9.3M to 6.5M\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n crates/cuda-backend/build.rs                       |   5 +-\n crates/cuda-backend/cuda/include/utils.cuh         |  29 +\n .../cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/logup_round0.cu       | 182 ++++++\n .../cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/zerocheck_round0.cu   | 175 ++++++\n crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs    | 141 +++++\n crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs     | 107 ++--\n .../src/logup_zerocheck/round0_batched.rs          | 629 +++++++++++++++++++++\n 7 files changed, 1222 insertions(+), 46 d