{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SGR8o2fRTSLpaUDbuC7nm9","type":"tool_result","content":"commit 5bec2ee15bab4388dc57c997751ae567b936ede9\nAuthor: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>\nDate:   Wed Apr 15 17:26:37 2026 +0200\n\n    Pre-compute logup Round 0 interaction rules at keygen time\n    \n    Move the logup interaction DAG construction, rule encoding, and\n    interaction-to-rule-index mapping from per-AIR proving time to\n    keygen time in AirDataGpu. This eliminates per-AIR SymbolicDagBuilder,\n    SymbolicRulesGpu::new(), rule encoding, and one H2D upload from\n    evaluate_round0_interactions_gpu, which now only computes per-challenge\n    weights and uploads them.\n    \n    New types:\n    - LogupRound0Rules: stores encoded rules on GPU + interaction mappings\n    - InteractionRuleMapping: maps interaction expressions to rule indices\n    \n    Replaces the logup_round0_buffer_size: u32 field with the full\n    LogupRound0Rules struct in AirDataGpu.\n    \n    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs    |  6 +-\n crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/round0.rs | 89 +++++------------------\n crates/cuda-backend/src/pkey.rs                   | 81 ++++++++++++++++++---\n 3 files changed, 90 insertions(+), 86 deletions(-)\n[rerun: b47]","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fa62649b-653a-4cec-aa74-3431ae869005","uuid":"6cd89f6f-eb76-4c01-b578-a93ef5eddde9","timestamp":"2026-04-15T17:11:56.436Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"commit 5bec2ee15bab4388dc57c997751ae567b936ede9\nAuthor: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>\nDate:   Wed Apr 15 17:26:37 2026 +0200\n\n    Pre-compute logup Round 0 interaction rules at keygen time\n    \n    Move the logup interaction DAG construction, rule encoding, and\n    interaction-to-rule-index mapping from per-AIR proving time to\n    keygen time in AirDataGpu. This eliminates per-AIR SymbolicDagBui