ltiply):\n\n**`_round0_extract_zerocheck_poly`**:\n```c\nint _round0_extract_zerocheck_poly(\n  FpExt* d_out,              // output polynomial coefficients\n  const FpExt* d_evals,      // evaluation sums (input)\n  const FpExt* d_transform,  // pre-computed matrix (row-major)\n  uint32_t input_size,       // (d-1)*skip_domain\n  uint32_t output_size       // sumcheck_round0_deg(l_skip, d) + 1\n) -> int;\n```\n\n**`_round0_extract_logup_polys`**:\n```c\nint _round0_extract_logup_polys(\n  FpExt* d_out_numer,        // numerator coefficients\n  FpExt* d_out_denom,        // denominator coefficients\n  const FracExt* d_evals,    // evaluations (numer/denom pairs)\n  const FpExt* d_transform,  // pre-computed matrix\n  uint32_t input_size,       // d*skip_domain\n  uint32_t output_size,      // d*skip_domain\n  FpExt norm_factor          // normalization for numer\n) -> int;\n```\n\n### 4. **`crates/cuda-backend/src/pkey.rs` - AirDataGpu Structure**\n\n```rust\npub struct AirDataGpu {\n  pub interaction_rules: InteractionEvalRules,\n  pub zerocheck_round0: ConstraintOnlyRules<true>,  // with buffering\n  pub zerocheck_mle: ConstraintOnlyRules<false>,    // without buffering\n  pub zerocheck_monomials: Option<ZerocheckMonomials>,\n  pub interaction_monomials: Option<InteractionMonomials>,\n  pub logup_round0_buffer_size: u32,  // pre-computed at keygen\n}\n```\n\n**Key field** (line 32-35):\n- `logup_round0_buffer_size: u32` - pre-computed DAG buffer size so Round 0 work item preparation can determine per-AIR buffer sizes without rebuilding the DAG\n\n### 5. **FFI Bindings in `crates/cuda-backend/src/cuda/logup_zerocheck.rs`**\n\n**Repr(C) Descriptor Types**:\n```rust\n#[repr(C)]\npub struct MainMatrixPtrs<T> {\n  pub data: *const T,\n  pub air_width: u32,\n}\n\n#[repr(C)]\npub struct BlockCtx {\n  pub local_block_idx_x: u32,\n  pub air_idx: u32,  // local AIR index\n}\n\n#[repr(C)]\npub struct ZerocheckCtx {\n  pub eval_ctx: EvalCoreCtx,\n  pub d_intermediates: *mut EF,\n  pub num_y: u32,\n  pub d_eq_xi: *const EF,\n  pub d_rules: *const std::ffi::c_void,\n  pub rules_len: usize,\n  pub d_used_nodes: *const usize,\n  pub used_nodes_len: usize,\n  pub buffer_size: u32,\n}\n\n#[repr(C)]\npub struct LogupCtx {\n  pub eval_ctx: EvalCoreCtx,\n  pub d_intermediates: *mut EF,\n  pub num_y: u32,\n  pub d_eq_xi: *const EF,\n  pub d_challenges: *const EF,\n  pub d_eq_3bs: *const EF,\n  pub d_rules: *const std::ffi::c_void,\n  pub rules_len: usize,\n  pub d_used_nodes: *const usize,\n  pub d_pair_idxs: *const u32,\n  pub used_nodes_len: usize,\n  pub buffer_size: u32,\n}\n```\n\n**Buffer size computation functions** (Lines 328-382):\n- `_logup_r0_temp_sums_buffer_size(buffer_size, skip_domain, num_x, num_cosets, max_temp_bytes) -> usize`\n- `_logup_r0_intermediates_buffer_size(buffer_size, skip_domain, num_x, num_cosets, max_temp_bytes) -> usize`\n- `_zerocheck_r0_temp_sums_buffer_size(buffer_size, skip_domain, num_x, num_cosets, max_temp_bytes) -> usize`\n- `_zerocheck_r0_intermediates_buffer_size(buffer_size, skip_domain, num_x, num_cosets, max_temp_bytes) -> usize`\n\n### 6. **Batch Infrastructure Pattern (for context)**\n\nFrom `batch_mle.rs` and `batch_mle.cu`:\n- `BlockCtx` + array of per-AIR contexts (`ZerocheckCtx` or `LogupCtx`)\n- Single kernel launch processes multiple AIRs with `blockIdx.x` indexing into descriptors\n- Pre-allocated intermediates buffer shared across traces\n- Enables amortization of kernel launch overhead\n\n### Key Design Patterns\n\n1. **Three-phase orchestration**: Prepare → Execute → Gather\n2. **Pre-computed extraction matrices**: Eliminates per-AIR CPU post-processing\n3. **Descriptor-array pattern**: BlockCtx arrays for multi-AIR batching\n4. **Dual kernel variants**: Lockstep vs coset-parallel, selected by domain size threshold\n5. **Stream-ordered async frees**: cudaFreeAsync for fallback buffers, physical peak tracking via explicit syncs\n6. **Per-thread buffer pre-allocation**: Avoids per-AIR mutex contention at 95th percentile threshold\n7. **Round-robin work distribution**: Height-sorted + round-robin for load balance across threads\n\n**File locations**:\n- Orchestration: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/mod.rs` (lines 1022-1448)\n- Per-AIR processing: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/logup_zerocheck/round0.rs`\n- Zerocheck kernels: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/zerocheck_round0.cu`\n- Logup kernels: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/logup_round0.cu`\n- Extraction kernels: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/cuda/src/logup_zerocheck/round0_extract.cu`\n- Proving key data: `/home/georg/stark-backend/crates/cuda-backend/src/pkey.rs` (lines 24-150)"}],"totalDurationMs":85936,"totalTokens":77077,"totalToolUseCount":30,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":961,"cache_read_input_tokens":70781,"output_tokens":5330,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":961},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":5,"output_tokens":5330,"cache_read_input_tokens":70781,"cache_creation_input_tokens":961,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":961,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"toolStats":{"readCount":22,"searchCount":2,"bashCount":6,"editFileCount":0,"linesAdded":0,"linesRemoved":0,"otherToolCount":0}}}
